      <h1 id="virt-creating-vms-uploading-images" class="group scroll-mt-20">Creating VMs by uploading images<a href="#virt-creating-vms-uploading-images" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h1>
      <p class="_abstract">You can create virtual machines (VMs) by uploading operating system images from your local machine.</p>
